{"availability":"available","full":"Selleo/mentingo","name":"mentingo","description":"Open-source AI-native LMS with AI Mentor & role-play. Self-hosted alternative to Moodle, Docebo, TalentLMS, Thinkific, Teachable and Open edX.","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":92,"forks":29,"created":"2024-08-01T10:17:21Z","updated":"2026-10-10T13:55:58Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mentingo.com","topics":["ai-lms","ai-mentor","ai-tutor","compliance-training","corporate-training","docebo-alternative","edtech","hrtech","learning-management-system","lms","moodle-alternative","open-source-lms","openedx-alternative","roleplay","scorm","self-hosted","training","typescript","white-label","xapi"],"demo":"https://demo.mentingo.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:19.173Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:19.173Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T00:25:19.173Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T16:06:06.513Z","stars":91,"forks":29},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:25:19.173Z","stars":92,"forks":29}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Mentingo is an open-source, self-hosted learning management system (LMS) with a built-in AI mentor, built for corporate L&D, employee onboarding and compliance training.","MIT-licensed, white-label and multi-tenant - run it on your own infrastructure, brand it as your own, and keep every learner record inside your organisation.","Live demo · Quick start · Deploy on AWS · Features · Security & compliance · FAQ · Docs · Commercial support"],"features":["Practise conversations instead of watching slides. A voice and chat AI mentor runs real-time role-play for sales, compliance and customer-support scenarios, and scores the attempt automatically.","Turn the documents you already have into a course. The AI course architect converts knowledge bases, policies and internal documentation into structured, interactive courses in minutes.","Grade open-ended answers withou